    "title": "Measurement of |V(cb)| and the Form-Factor Slope in Bbar --> D l- nubar Decays in Events Tagged by a Fully Reconstructed B Meson",
    "arxiv": "[hep-ex/0904.4063v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/0904.4063)",
